G3049.b:
⟪λογίζομαι⟫
(< λόγος), [in LXX chiefly for ⁨חשׁב⁩;]
⟪1.⟫ prop., of numerical calculation, ⟪to count⟫, ⟪reckon⟫: c. acc. seq. μετά, ⟦Mark 15:23|Mk 15:23⟧(LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), ⟦Luke 22:37|Lk 22:37⟧.
⟪2.⟫ Metaph., without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons;
	⟪(a)⟫ ⟪to reckon⟫, ⟪take into account⟫: c. acc. rei, ⟦1 Corinthians 13:5|I Co 13:5⟧; id. seq. dat. pers., ⟦Romans 4:3|Ro 4:3⟧(LXX), ⟦Romans 4:4|4⟧, ⟦Romans 4:6|6⟧, ⟦Romans 4:8|8⟧(LXX), ⟦2 Corinthians 5:19|II Co 5:19⟧, ⟦2 Timothy 4:16|II Ti 4:16⟧; seq. εἰς (cf. Heb. ⁨נֶחֱשׁב לְ⁩; Bl., § 33, 3), ⟦Acts 19:27|Ac 19:27⟧, ⟦Romans 2:26|Ro 2:26⟧ ⟦Romans 4:3|4:3⟧, ⟦Romans 4:5|5⟧, ⟦Romans 4:9|9-11⟧, ⟦Romans 4:22|22-24⟧ ⟦Romans 9:8|9:8⟧, ⟦Galatians 3:6|Ga 3:6⟧(LXX), ⟦James 2:23|Ja 2:23⟧(LXX);
	⟪(b)⟫ ⟪to consider⟫, ⟪calculate⟫: c. acc. rei, ⟦Philippians 4:8|Phl 4:8⟧; seq. ὅτι, ⟦John 11:50|Jo 11:50⟧, ⟦Hebrews 11:10|He 11:10⟧; τοῦτο, ὅτι, ⟦2 Corinthians 10:11|II Co 10:11⟧; c. acc. pers., c. inf., ⟦Romans 6:11|Ro 6:11⟧; seq. ὡς, ⟦Romans 8:36|Ro 8:36⟧(LXX);
	⟪(c)⟫ ⟪to suppose⟫, ⟪judge⟫, ⟪deem⟫: ⟦1 Corinthians 13:11|I Co 13:11⟧; ὡς, ⟦1 Peter 5:12|I Pe 5:12⟧; οὕτως, ⟦1 Corinthians 4:1|I Co 4:1⟧; c. acc. rei, ⟦2 Corinthians 3:5|II Co 3:5⟧; id. seq. εἰς, ⟦2 Corinthians 12:6|II Co 12:6⟧; ὅτι, ⟦Romans 8:18|Ro 8:18⟧; τοῦτο, ὅτι, ⟦Romans 2:3|Ro 2:3⟧, ⟦2 Corinthians 10:7|II Co 10:7⟧; c. inf., ⟦2 Corinthians 11:5|II Co 11:5⟧; acc. et inf., ⟦Romans 3:28|Ro 3:28⟧ ⟦Romans 14:14|14:14⟧, ⟦Philippians 3:13|Phl 3:13⟧; c. acc. pers. seq. ὡς, ⟦2 Corinthians 10:2|II Co 10:2⟧;
	⟪(d)⟫ ⟪to purpose⟫, ⟪decide⟫: c. inf. (Eur., Or., 555), ⟦2 Corinthians 10:2|II Co 10:2⟧ (cf. ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).†

G3062.b:
